  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwabbanode.com%252faffiliate%252faloneonaraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1513894/description_a416dc60-4aac-40cf-bb45-83824937b99d.png\" alt=\"Mod包标题：孤舟求生 - 在无尽海洋中生存\" width=\"850\" height=\"445\"></a></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>一款让你在无尽海洋中生存的木筏模组整合包</strong></h1>\n<h1><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1513894/description_c9fc0688-1562-45b1-9b72-48acd09bae1f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"45\"></strong></h1>\n<h3><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwabbanode.com%252faffiliate%252faloneonaraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1513894/description_0663d6d7-c36f-4ccd-bcaf-55fb431b282a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"837\" height=\"80\"></a></h3>\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1513894/description_e031080c-a2c2-4216-8341-5fef05c836ca.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"45\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><a style=\"color:#236fa1\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/haubna/collections\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>-&gt; 添加物理模组专业版以获取逼真的海浪效果 -&gt;</strong></a></span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1513894/description_aaf0b279-4149-41c6-b353-7e2b4b46f8fc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"45\"></strong></span></p>\n<h3>世界生成与结构</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>海洋：</strong>通过 <em>Ocean World</em>、<em>Deeper Oceans</em> 和 <em>Tectonic</em> 修改世界生成，营造主导性的深水地形。</li>\n<li><strong>敌对实体：</strong>大型海上威胁包括灾厄村民战舰、军舰、维京长船和三列桨座战船。</li>\n<li><strong>探索：</strong>通过 <em>Aquamirae</em>、<em>YUNG's Better Ocean Monuments</em> 和 <em>Underwater Village</em> 扩展水下内容。</li>\n<li><strong>起始条件：</strong>初始出生点被锁定在由 <em>Raft world spawn</em> 提供的木筏结构上。</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1513894/description_23738f4f-8363-4f59-98fc-7cf6e042964d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"45\">\n<h2><strong>生存与环境</strong></h2>\n</blockquote>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>烹饪系统：</strong>以 <em>Farmer's Delight</em> 为基础，扩展了 <em>Ocean's Delight</em>、<em>Tide's Delight</em> 和 <em>Aquamirae Delight</em>，提供基于海洋的进度发展。</li>\n<li><strong>大气系统：</strong><em>Weather, Storms &amp; Tornadoes</em> 引入了严重影响航行的恶劣气象事件。</li>\n<li><strong>海洋生物：</strong>通过 <em>Alex's Mobs</em>、<em>Aquaculture 2</em> 和 <em>Fish of Thieves</em> 增加了 fauna 的密度和多样性。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwabbanode.com%252faffiliate%252faloneonaraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1513894/description_6079b7fb-727c-43d1-92ec-a233d5fe984c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"45\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwabbanode.com%252faffiliate%252faloneonaraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1223093/description_ce725e62-5d55-4605-bf53-20e7911d7c5f.png\" alt=\"孤舟求生 Mod包赞助商：在无尽海洋中生存\" width=\"850\" height=\"170\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">如果你想支持我，你可以启动一个服务器<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwabbanode.com%252faffiliate%252faloneonaraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#236fa1;text-decoration:underline\"><strong>WABBANODE</strong>&nbsp;</span></a></span>使用 <a style=\"color:#f1c40f\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwabbanode.com%252faffiliate%252faloneonaraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此</a> 链接，你将获得 <strong>TRUYTY</strong> 代码的 <strong>-25%</strong> 折扣</span></h3>\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">多人一起生存更容易！</span></strong></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1513894/description_99dd4369-7e84-427a-ac44-7f362bb5d794.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"45\"></p>\n<p>🔻 想要添加更多<strong><span style=\"color:#236fa1\">水生</span></strong>细节吗？</p>\n<div><hr><a href=\"https://discord.gg/NuQV3ZkVxR\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1168668/description_9227c40d-ce36-4b21-bf38-0ed69b1f8337.gif\" width=\"803\" height=\"103\"></a></div>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">如果你是内容创作者，你将获得专属等级！</span></h4>\n<hr>\n<h2><strong>如果你喜欢这个模组整合包，我推荐其他几个！</strong></h2>\n<h5><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/spellnomia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1145/853/638711902228707430.png\" alt=\"Spellnomia 模组整合包\" width=\"110\" height=\"110\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/apocalypssia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1302/26/638846418762745282.png\" alt=\"Apocalypssia 模组整合包\" width=\"110\" height=\"110\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/dungeonia-rpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1305578/changelog/changelog_67961805-1699-435f-9ffb-cdbe584cc909.png\" alt=\"Dungeonia 模组整合包\" width=\"110\" height=\"110\"></a></h5>\n<hr>\n<h1>立即下载木筏模组整合包！</h1>",
